*/target/*
target
# Stray build directories from `cargo --target-dir <name>`; plain `target`
# does not match them, and 1778 of their files once reached a commit. Anchored
# to the repository root, and the two conventional names for custom target
# definitions are re-included, so this cannot silently swallow them.
/target*/
!/targets/
!/target-specs/
build*.txt
*~
\#*
.\#*
*.swp
*.orig
*.bak

*.s
